---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Partners" description="Practising medicine the way it should be.">

<section class="hero-subpage">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69d6375ea03a61d5a2486655_artem-kovalev-fk3XUcfTAvk-unsplash.jpg');"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">For doctors</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">Medicine as it<br>should be practised.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Lasting patient relationships and the time to do them justice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="section-ivory">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split fade-up">
      <div class="split-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/pears-on-plate.jpg" alt="Our philosophy" />
      </div>
      <div class="split-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</span>
        <h2>Care we would want for ourselves.</h2>
        <p>We aim to practise medicine the way we would want it provided to ourselves and to the people we love. We believe lasting relationships are the foundation of good care: when you truly know your patients, you can offer something genuinely holistic.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;">As a clinician, our model offers you something increasingly rare: time. Unhurried consultations, continuous care relationships, and less ethical compromise.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sunken">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Prevention and disease management</span>
      <h2>A broader view of preventive care.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">We map individual disease risks carefully, drawing on medical and family history as well as measurement data, and address those risks early. We use validated risk scores but also develop our own science-based tools for areas where validated methods are still lacking.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Prevention, for us, means more than early detection. It means thoughtful disease management, preventing downstream complications, and having the judgement to know when not to intervene. We act early where it matters, and resist medicalisation where the evidence calls for restraint.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Lasting change rarely comes from a single consultation. Our longitudinal model creates the conditions for something different: continuous support, regular contact, and the kind of ongoing relationship where you can help your patients make real lifestyle changes and achieve long-term goals together.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-ivory">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Evidence-based care</span>
      <h2>Meaningful findings, not diagnostics as an end in themselves.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">We don't run tests for the sake of running tests. We focus on actionable findings and translate them into something meaningful for the patient. We continuously monitor the quality of our care and look for ways to improve. We use validated methods and adopt new innovations into our workflow where the evidence supports them.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">When your patient needs more than primary care can offer, the right people are within reach. We have built a broad multiprofessional network of local and international specialists across disciplines, making it straightforward to consult and refer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sunken">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 720px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our model in practice</span>
      <h2>Built for continuity.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="what-grid fade-up" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="what-card" style="padding: var(--s-8);">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-bottom: var(--s-5);"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        <h3>Your own named patients</h3>
        <p>You are responsible for your own named patients. Our membership model brings clarity to both sides: a personal care plan created at onboarding provides structure and continuity, while the patient's chosen tier sets a predictable rhythm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="what-card" style="padding: var(--s-8);">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-bottom: var(--s-5);"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
        <h3>The onboarding visit</h3>
        <p>Every care relationship begins with a thorough onboarding consultation. Through an unhurried conversation and examination, you have the time to understand the patient as a whole person and build the foundation for genuine trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="what-card" style="padding: var(--s-8);">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-bottom: var(--s-5);"><path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="2"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h4"/></svg>
        <h3>Personalised care plan</h3>
        <p>During onboarding, you draw up an individualised care plan covering the necessary investigations, follow-ups, and actions for the next three, six, and twelve months. The plan makes care proactive, structured, and transparent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="what-card" style="padding: var(--s-8);">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-bottom: var(--s-5);"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
        <h3>Technology as a tool</h3>
        <p>Our technology helps build a 360-degree picture of the patient by bringing together current and historical health data. Everything is stored for longitudinal comparison and trend analysis. The goal is a rich, living record — not just a snapshot in time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-fullbleed">
  <div class="cta-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/river-evening.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
  <div class="cta-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container cta-content fade-up">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2>Interested in joining our team?</h2>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">Get in touch and we'll tell you more.</p>
      <a href="/en/contact" class="btn" style="background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>